<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AFTI - Stage 4: The Greenhouse Council &amp; First Mission</title>
    <script src="afti-core.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root { 
            --bg-color: #0f172a; 
            --card-bg: #1e293b; 
            --text-color: #f8fafc; 
            --primary: #27ae60; 
            --hud-bg: #144d29; 
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --danger-muted: #f43f5e;
            --warn: #f59e0b;
            --grey-slate: #334155;
        }
        body { 
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; 
            background: var(--bg-color); 
            color: var(--text-color); 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
            display: flex; 
            justify-content: center; 
            align-items: center; 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container { 
            width: 100%; 
            max-width: 840px; 
            background: var(--card-bg); 
            border-radius: 16px; 
            padding: 40px; 
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); 
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        .hud-bar { 
            background: var(--hud-bg); 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            padding: 12px 20px; 
            margin-bottom: 30px; 
            display: flex; 
            justify-content: space-between; 
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .story-image-slot { 
            width: 100%; 
            height: 220px; 
            background: #0f172a; 
            border-radius: 10px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.3); 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
            margin-bottom: 25px; 
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .prose-block {
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .prose-block p {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .mission-spotlight {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .mission-title {
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .mission-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .section-header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0 15px 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .paths-array {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .path-option-card {
            background: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .path-option-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .path-option-card.completed {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.04);
        }
        .path-info h4 {
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .path-info p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .path-badge {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .xp-tag {
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.15);
            color: #4ade80;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
        /* Modal Popup Styles */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .modal-content {
            background: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 30px;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            position: relative;
        }
        .modal-title {
            color: #4ade80;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .modal-body {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .close-modal-btn {
            background: #334155;
            color: #f8fafc;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .close-modal-btn:hover {
            background: #475569;
        }
        .footer-action {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.3);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <!-- GLOBAL HUD BAR -->
    <div class="hud-bar">
        <span>Path: <span id="hud-track" style="color: var(--accent);">Foster-Alum Track</span></span>
        <div>
            <span>Global XP: <span id="global-points" style="color: #4ade80;">400</span></span>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'" style="margin-left: 15px; background: #334155; color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer;">🏠 Exit</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STORY IMAGE SLOT -->
    <div class="story-image-slot">
        ⚡ [Illustration: An eclectic crew gathered around a scarred wooden table in an empty, echoing greenhouse at dusk—mapping strategies like a coalition of heroes united by their origin stories]
    </div>

    <h2 style="color: #fff; margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Greenhouse Council: First Strategy Session</h2>

    <div class="prose-block">
        <p>They trickled in from completely different corners of the valley—individuals who, by all normal metrics, would never occupy the same room, let alone form a coalition. Looking around the scarred wooden table set up inside the echoing shell of an empty greenhouse, the assembly looks less like an orderly agricultural crew and more like a tactical team of unlikely heroes. What binds them isn't background or polish, but an unyielding, burning passion to grow and to uplift those whose bodies or circumstances are failing them because of their own grueling origin stories.</p>
        <p>Spread out across the table are the initial operational assignments, dossiers of regional elders, and regional soil health registries. You notice the entries from the <strong>Standard Track</strong> and the <strong>Capital-Backed Track</strong> on the clipboard. While they brought baseline structural experience and mechanical investments, your grueling path through systemic gridlocks has sharpened your analytical eye. The team values your capacity to spot compliance errors instantly—it's time to map your specialization profiles and secure the buffer zone before nightfall.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- MISSION SPOTLIGHT -->
    <div class="mission-spotlight">
        <div class="mission-title">🌲 Mission Parameters: The Buffer-Zone Trial</div>
        <div class="mission-desc">
            Linn County fire-buffer zones must be cleared of forestry slash before the ground freeze sets in. Review your team's specialties and execute tactical logging adjustments below to maximize your portfolio value.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- INTEGRATED MODULE 1: TEAM PROFILES -->
    <div class="section-header">👥 Team Operational Specialties</div>
    <div class="paths-array">
        <div class="path-option-card" onclick="openModal('marcus')">
            <div class="path-info">
                <h4>Marcus — Advanced Field Logistics</h4>
                <p>Navigating physical trauma barriers through double-buddy van routing.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="path-badge">Review Profile</span>
        </div>

        <div class="path-option-card" onclick="openModal('sarah')">
            <div class="path-info">
